## 1. Introduction

This document provides a detailed design for an AI-driven trade surveillance system aimed at detecting and preventing market abuse. The system will leverage machine learning models to analyze trading patterns, identify anomalies, and flag suspicious activities for further investigation by compliance teams. This design is intended to be sprint-ready, providing sufficient detail for development teams to commence implementation.

