## 9. Error Handling Strategy

| Error Code | Cause | Response | User-Visible Message |
|---|---|---|---|
| `TRADE_NOT_FOUND` | Trade ID provided does not exist in the database. | 404 Not Found | The specified trade could not be found. Please verify the trade ID. |
| `MODEL_INFERENCE_FAILED` | Error during ML model prediction. | 500 Internal Server Error | An internal error occurred during analysis. Please try again later. |
| `ALERTING_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE` | Alerting service is unreachable. | 503 Service Unavailable | Could not send alert notification. Please contact support. |
| `INVALID_INPUT` | Malformed request payload. | 400 Bad Request | Invalid request data provided. Please check the input format. |

## 10. Test Strategy

**10.1. Unit Test (SurveillanceServiceTests.cs)**

```csharp
[Fact]
public async Task AnalyzeTradeAsync_WhenTradeIsAbusive_ShouldGenerateAndSendAlert()
{
    // Arrange
    var mockTradeRepository = new Mock<ITradeRepository>();
    var mockModelInferenceService = new Mock<IModelInferenceService>();
    var mockAlertingService = new Mock<IAlertingService>();
    var tradeId = Guid.NewGuid();
    var trade = new Trade(tradeId, "XYZ", DateTimeOffset.UtcNow, 100m, 1000, Guid.NewGuid(), "BUY");
    var alert = new Alert(Guid.NewGuid(), tradeId, DateTimeOffset.UtcNow, "WashTrading", "Potential WashTrading detected.", "New");

    mockTradeRepository.Setup(r => r.GetByIdAsync(tradeId)).ReturnsAsync(trade);
    mockModelInferenceService.Setup(s => s.PredictAbusePatternAsync(trade)).ReturnsAsync(new AbusePrediction { IsAbusive = true, Score = 0.9, PatternName = "WashTrading" });
    mockAlertingService.Setup(s => s.SendAlertAsync(It.IsAny<Alert>())).Returns(Task.CompletedTask);

    var service = new SurveillanceService(mockTradeRepository.Object, mockModelInferenceService.Object, mockAlertingService.Object);

    // Act
    var result = await service.AnalyzeTradeAsync(tradeId);

    // Assert
    Assert.NotNull(result);
    Assert.Equal(alert.TradeId, result.TradeId);
    mockAlertingService.Verify(s => s.SendAlertAsync(It.IsAny<Alert>()), Times.Once);
}
```

